    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09b0a2ae1fee6885890d85b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嗯…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a4e8d20aa5151334b4c38a65a505a9374b636972b6acc835853e25c1ff32890f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "140015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cbd04deb55f08e7d241f905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我来做可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6e06ed049a309ee2b07c06238a9b3f5cde13bd9ca937dc74197c89d54dac5a8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "140016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfb8d6c29bd2c8d12cb44d94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9852121b46bc3ea60cc2bf9ba1e1633b23e248d37c2f7aeca6a1854e4d6ab164",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "140017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:542cc7117e28bdfc00e1c809",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edde3a8d21b92c27a5c507c923669ab158c7e313c638cf35c7fcfc2b08ad7741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "140018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0ec12b919b5f93a83c5bdb4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "明天能拿到这个哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "edcc225df8a449436b040cb95aec3186c7b3c65f9ce7196721046f5c7674ff9f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "15"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b09555ee137b124ddc0b659f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "唔…脸好烫呢…\n要不要喝点冷饮…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76a1ddd4c701c1b0a6d75662611024c55e136d080114c02d1ab3ca3d17425a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff8d17e5375d0b56e71bae29",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系的，不用客气。\n我还能行…还能好好跑的…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dcb076dbe302ee832266fc2ab126e9fda24c26358c2d05c3d0ffb173c5f8259",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0ff15c34770bdbdfbd46bcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "开始得越早，\n就能走得越远，比谁都领先。\n来吧，现在马上开始训练！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba3b93ea323c62af5c471f4d16b7c3ffa811fe0aa503fe1bf89e56c2ea06ba2c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f600fdc4ec7ba5be53b97d68",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "脑海中的构想已经完全成形了！\n目标清晰得让我连停下脚步\n都觉得是在浪费时间！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07a1b2825694a422cf442e675126ff1c358dbd91cdb69af9db5d31af657b5a83",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49e8230605bb008d7fb594ad",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家已经跑起来了…！\n喂，我也该出发了\n可以吧？我已经准备好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6d61dd79e8d749244e0751d1b2b2030f27a9f833ff45249d763f1abf5fba27f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4101c5d00a3e406d82e6af74",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "假如有能劈开大海的手杖……\n呵呵，我想一路跑到\n地平线的那一头呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "df96a558670b68453cdfc13e37508f450b0fdd7ef99d1fc3949f5fb6331a6df9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cf8574ceddfd49523558e45",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冰敷用的护具也有…\n嗯，准备好了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c2394b10fd9ea3edf0b2b14b52d79827f213cabecc6bd277b0326de31f77691",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:132fedac6e97375143743b26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天从什么开始？\n照你的行事风格，\n应该已经有计划了吧。说给我听听。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8183a035d46a3d72ae082e409cfd9058a5e5e0087dcf7f32abd5c0a93830fed0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53af32df32430dc2b8ce495c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这脚趾甲，怎么会剪得\n这么短啊……真是的……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b9f32bd4eb458d024783cc8c7b370180b7e58e31d8372bac08e5058d8944be0a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5eeea5cefb438be6caa37ac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没关系，继续吧。\n……难得有这段时间\n浪费掉太可惜了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5cbade652335f44d8c7b91e673b8f1cfb5e8da56f8fa4b382327f3298179ef17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a279ecb2c868f2b111719f7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，沙尘…\n唉…风好像有点大呢…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6f1405db094dbe5e398f83d1b5c0411bc899a422247c65f05b6c830f5e28bc98",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1143bf93cd44f73ccef9aec7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……那个孩子的鞋子，确实\n沾满了泥土。而我――\n不行，不能再这样下去了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ce50a35549ae57590fa6a5f20d2cb23d68afa82bac608a91382affb4c992ee7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9919ade199b25a118ed84fb9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你真的认为该这么做？\n那就告诉我理由。我们来把\n彼此的意见好好沟通清楚。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58d91ead852dae3158250ac369bef4fcb2b34184b0d55b9724d1251e452ab828",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0f4ffd0b63b8c1242ff470b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……我不能赞同。继续这种\n鲁莽的做法，迟早会撑不住的。\n我不愿那样。――绝对，不愿意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69b0529482ce15a3a1401b9e2f26c65fb793ed1b2ee27769ad02e4971d63c38b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f98f39e87354210a4055fde5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状态已经好到极点，\n完全无可挑剔！\n就这样一路直冲――向着胜利！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5bf99f3814117c0d1fb50df20842c63437681feb4ae6aa3fad99fe373377a108",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c8290a895fe5b5c14650fe1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要始终强烈渴望，\n无论哪里都能抵达。\n就像飞越大海的蝴蝶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "846cd7f223c1d3b20b9bafe612d779d029ad21ba0f86e35c0590b87ae70c1065",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75580c712e75ac2e6aae0bf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "没有什么是无法超越的。\n只要心中，\n怀着坚定的信念！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c934ab247a80b67423cfd9e6e76ca86bd9ef6040b786ba08e2f30c7ce784a87b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5374afed39f70bf52924c8b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有那么多人――有那么多声音，\n都在呼唤我的名字……\n呵呵，真的让我充满力量！",
      "source_fingerprint": "305df616b4e97a1da6099747a5238b53809aca58daa1fa89695699b8f0b19b10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd5696573e4c255aa984a0d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想要的东西，\n我会一直伸手去争取。\n直到亲手将它――牢牢握住！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fb255ddd527b41818ee1c8a8da82a526b699ce2c699686f8e071f520809a2843",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8eb49932ced2b38196126dd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "准备都已经做好了。\n无论面对怎样的局面\n我都能灵活应对！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7bccf08e448f92eb3d784aaa0944510d2ab9eb358b5fc337b7bf06f355efc0fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b29ee7d6083fccfdd01e6f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论是怎样的诅咒还是常识，\n都与我无关。\n用这双腿，我只为取胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "293a29d6360ca77dd97a4ce4ab4283acdc591b7c0e16f54d91bc0d6856bd22d2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cbf4eddbeb77d77ae5ea115",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "无论从什么位置我都会追上并反超。\n我就是为此而奔跑的。\n每天的努力都是为了这一刻。",
      "source_fingerprint": "400e503498d2731af4ebbb99db0d7494ba791e6274f5b0a6f7b614eb45c0a2ad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:207e590b23d3bc496245f9ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "奔跑的理由只有一个。\n——因为我就是想赢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebf88e41aa963bb2c382830f111888bbc69ccc791054175894f1db8ac1b8f1d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e7205da6ab2c1888b03109f1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这点波动完全在预料之中……\n没问题，我能调整过来……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1e09040a7dc3db1b6217cc8e471a486a6978c6f72f4ad83efab55fc736bb98f5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4847fe277ae6c66daff74fae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道只要坚持做自己，\n就没有什么跨越不了的……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef9b13bad8497f0849da18c911063fc7898b9a6f93e3065b686cc32b3cf534f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20033"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8445c0a0b9bfae8377c04073",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不想输。\n无论是对谁…包括对我自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "35d1d865f6312a2ef0f18ef51015e8cadc0520498f24cb420006561feac11349",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20034"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ffcd93eb11bb7e13e299b98d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我能行的，我…！\n因为，我从未认为\n自己做不到…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d1030b031e549642fae9e80be4f3fe774a677a8b8594878f1cac764c165551b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbb523c0da0ebd2060611fd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我绝不怀疑自己的\n实力……！无论何时！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bdab167090da06a6d38fefa16f20ae2ba968292df277dfce208003b783a014a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1129",
        "20036"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
